# <%= it.title ?? "<Title>" %>

## Summary

*Pending — outcomes to be populated when this decision is accepted.*

^summary

## Context

<The situation that prompts this decision. Current state, forces at
play, constraints. One short paragraph or a few bullets.>

## Decision

<What was decided, in one paragraph. The core resolution.>

## Why

<Rationale. Why this and not a plausible alternative.>

## Options considered

<Optional. Use when the decision is a choice between alternatives.>

### Option A: <name>

<Tradeoffs, pros, cons.>

### Option B: <name>

<Tradeoffs, pros, cons.>

## Consequences

<Downstream effects — what becomes easier, what becomes harder,
what binds future work. Optional.>

## Migration

<If current state needs to move to the decided state, how. Optional.>

## Open questions

<Unresolved sub-decisions, gaps the decision doesn't address. Delete
if there are none.>

- <question>

## Notes

<Caveats, references to related discussions, context that doesn't
fit elsewhere. Delete if there's nothing to add.>
